WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.048
Hi, I'm Ollie. I explain IEP and 504 basics in plain words.

00:00:07.248 --> 00:00:14.520
We cover what the plans are, what common accommodations mean, and your part in helping them happen.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:21.080
For example, ask me: what is the difference between an IEP and a 504?
